# Specs discipline

- Plans, milestones, and ADRs live under `.specs/`.
- Update specs on the same branch as the code change before merge.
- Prefer citing normative docs by pointer; do not duplicate facts that will drift.
- Spec-only commits use a `docs:` Conventional Commit prefix.
